    description: "Per ADR-0028 Phase 3 Cluster B. File docs/audits/<NN>-evidence-type-cluster-b-resolution-status.md with per-row fold target. Migrate ~18 *_unresolved / unresolved_* producer emit sites to set evidence_type to canonical inference label + Edge.is_resolved=False. Mechanical pattern; smallest blast radius of the four clusters. Worked examples: ast_annotation_unresolved → ast_annotation + is_resolved=False; ast_decorator_unresolved → ast_decorator + is_resolved=False; unresolved_method_call → method_call (or post-collapse ast_call) + is_resolved=False; luajit_ffi_unresolved may need new canonical (e.g. luajit_ffi_lookup) — audit decides. Tag: analysis_quality."  # 4806
